<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<TcPlcObject Version="1.1.0.1" ProductVersion="3.1.4024.12">
  <DUT Name="ST_4PViciValveSampleNames" Id="{35be0b4c-67ce-4822-bad8-6de307e4269c}">
    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
    Purpose: keep one human-readable label for the sample loaded on each of
    the four ports of a 4-port VICI selector valve, so the operator screens,
    the generated EPICS IOC and downstream analysis can name the sample that
    a given valve position is drawing from.

    Usage: FB_4PortViciValve and FB_4PVICI_EPS each own one instance
    (stSampleNames) and publish it under 'pv: SampleNames', which maps the
    members to <prefix>:SampleNames:01 ... :04. The strings are operator
    annotation only - no PLC logic reads them. They are writable and
    readable from EPICS ('io: io') and are restored by the IOC on restart
    ('autosave_pass0: VAL DESC'), so a saved name survives a PLC or IOC
    restart. An empty string means that port has not been labelled yet.

    Objectives: one label per valve port, addressed by port number in the PV
    name; free text so that any sample naming scheme works; labels preserved
    across restarts; and a separate struct per valve size (this one for the
    4-port valves, ST_12ViciValveSampleNames for the 12-port valves) so the
    exported PV set matches the valve's port count.

    History: 2025-05-29 Josue Zamudio - struct present from the project
    restructure commit (9b2fb2c).
             2026-06-25 Josue Zamudio - autosave_pass0 added so the IOC saves
    the names (dfd51d5).
             2026-11-28 header and per-member comments added; no declaration
    or behaviour change (audit finding #449, conv_321640e095c0).
*)
TYPE ST_4PViciValveSampleNames :
STRUCT
      {attribute 'pytmc' := '
        pv: 01
        io: io
        autosave_pass0: VAL DESC
     '}
     s1 : STRING; // port 1 sample name, free text (max 80 chars, no units)
     {attribute 'pytmc' := '
        pv: 02
        io: io
        autosave_pass0: VAL DESC
     '}
     s2 : STRING; // port 2 sample name, free text (max 80 chars, no units)
     {attribute 'pytmc' := '
        pv: 03
        io: io
        autosave_pass0: VAL DESC
     '}
     s3 : STRING; // port 3 sample name, free text (max 80 chars, no units)
     {attribute 'pytmc' := '
        pv: 04
        io: io
        autosave_pass0: VAL DESC
     '}
     s4 : STRING; // port 4 sample name, free text (max 80 chars, no units)
END_STRUCT
END_TYPE
]]></Declaration>
  </DUT>
</TcPlcObject>